OL,3,GNEWSARedeveloped airport lounge to open
OL,4,Ain November
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first phase of a project to
OL,7,Fredevelop Jersey Airport's departure
OL,8,Flounge is due to open to the public in
OL,9,Fearly November.
OL,11,FThe work forms part of a #10m project
OL,12,Fby Ports of Jersey to modernise the
OL,13,Fairport, improve passenger facilities
OL,14,Fand replace ageing infrastructure.
OL,16,FProject leaders said the new lounge
OL,17,Fwould include an improved layout,
OL,18,Fexpanded seating areas and a new
OL,19,Fmezzanine level with runway views.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
